"Convert images, videos, and audio without changing the original file." = "转换图片、视频和音频，同时不改变原始文件。";
"Convert imports a working copy into the app. Clearing the conversion workspace removes app-managed copies and outputs, so export anything you want to keep first." = "转换会将工作副本导入应用。清除转换工作区会移除应用管理的副本和输出文件，请先导出需要保留的结果。";
"Convert keeps imported working copies and outputs inside app-managed storage. The original outside the app is not replaced. Clear the workspace only after exporting results you want to keep." = "转换会将导入的工作副本和输出文件保存在应用管理的存储中，不会替换应用外的原文件。只有在导出需要保留的结果后，才清除工作区。";
"Deleted content may remain in Recently Deleted, and iOS storage totals can take time to recalculate. Check the relevant Recently Deleted location, then recheck iPhone Storage later." = "已删除的内容可能仍在“最近删除”中，iOS 存储总量也需要时间重新计算。请检查相应的“最近删除”位置，稍后再查看 iPhone 存储空间。";
"Deleted items move to Recently Deleted and may continue using storage until permanently removed. If iCloud Photos is enabled, deletion also syncs to your other devices." = "删除的项目会移至“最近删除”，永久移除前可能仍占用空间。如果启用了 iCloud 照片，删除操作也会同步到其他设备。";
"Deleting and reinstalling can remove local-only data and login state. Use it only when the app's data is synced or backed up and its own cleanup controls are not enough." = "删除并重新安装 App 可能会移除仅保存在本地的数据和登录状态。只有在数据已同步或备份，且 App 自带清理功能不足时才这样做。";
"Deletion stays user controlled" = "删除始终由用户控制";
"Device storage is not iCloud storage" = "设备存储空间不等于 iCloud 存储空间";
"Do not install profiles, grant unknown computer access, or erase the iPhone for a promised one-tap cache cleanup. Back up important data before any system reset." = "不要为了所谓的一键清理缓存而安装描述文件、允许未知电脑访问，或抹掉 iPhone。进行任何系统重置前，请先备份重要数据。";
"Does analysis or conversion upload my files?" = "分析或转换会上传我的文件吗？";
"Explore the results" = "探索结果";
"Files deleted from an authorized folder may not be recoverable. The app cannot promise that they will appear in Recently Deleted." = "从已授权文件夹删除的文件可能无法恢复。应用无法保证这些文件会出现在“最近删除”中。";
"Find the largest category" = "找出占用最大的类别";
