"Media analyzes photos and videos that you allow through the Photos library. Storage analyzes only a folder you choose. Convert works with copies imported into the app's private workspace." = "媒体分析你通过照片图库授权的照片和视频。存储只分析你选择的文件夹。转换处理导入应用私有工作区的副本。";
"Media needs Photos access to display and analyze library items. You can choose Full Access, Limited Access, or no access, and change the choice later in System Settings." = "媒体需要照片访问权限才能显示和分析图库项目。你可以选择“完全访问”“有限访问”或不允许访问，也可以稍后在系统设置中更改。";
"Meet the App" = "认识应用";
"No. It can analyze the Photos items you authorize, the folder you choose, and its own conversion workspace. Other apps and protected system storage remain private." = "不能。它只能分析你授权的照片项目、你选择的文件夹和自己的转换工作区。其他 App 及受保护的系统存储仍是私有的。";
"No. Media analysis, folder analysis, and conversion run on this device. Apple services or file providers may sync their own content according to your existing settings." = "不会。媒体分析、文件夹分析和转换都在此设备上运行。Apple 服务或文件提供商可能根据你现有的设置同步自己的内容。";
"Not necessarily. They are visually related candidates and can include different frames, edits, or resolutions. Always compare them before selecting one to remove." = "不一定。它们只是视觉上相关的候选项，可能包含不同画面、编辑版本或分辨率。选择移除前请务必比较。";
"Offload or delete" = "卸载或删除";
"Only the items selected in the system permission sheet are available. Counts, groups, and recommendations cannot include the rest of the library." = "只有系统权限页面中选择的项目可用。其余图库项目不会计入数量、分组或建议。";
"Open Media" = "打开媒体";
"Open a category" = "打开一个类别";
"Open before removing" = "移除前打开查看";
"Open iPhone Storage" = "打开 iPhone 存储空间";
"Opens Apple Support in your browser." = "在浏览器中打开 Apple 支持。";
"Permissions & Privacy" = "权限与隐私";
"Photos and some Files locations may offer Recently Deleted. A file removed through Storage may not be recoverable, so preview important items and keep a backup before deletion." = "照片和“文件”中的部分位置可能提供“最近删除”。通过存储删除的文件可能无法恢复，因此请在删除前预览重要项目并保留备份。";
"Photos keeps deleted items in Recently Deleted for recovery. They can still occupy space until removed permanently, so empty that album only after confirming you no longer need the files." = "照片会将删除的项目保留在“最近删除”中以便恢复。在永久移除前它们仍可能占用空间，因此确认不再需要后再清空该相簿。";
"Photos permission" = "照片权限";
"Quick Start" = "快速开始";
"Recheck after cleanup" = "清理后重新检查";
"Reduce app storage without expecting a universal cache cleaner." = "减少 App 占用的空间，但不要期待通用缓存清理器。";
"Remove Download and Delete are different" = "“移除下载”和“删除”不同";
"Remove Download frees the local copy but keeps the file in iCloud Drive. Delete removes the file from iCloud Drive and synced devices." = "“移除下载”会释放本地副本，但保留 iCloud Drive 中的文件。“删除”会从 iCloud Drive 和同步设备中移除文件。";
"Remove offline downloads first" = "先移除离线下载";
"Review before deleting" = "删除前检查";
"Review large videos, screenshots, and similar photos safely." = "安全查看大视频、截屏和相似照片。";
"Review long videos, 4K videos, screen recordings, and large screenshots first. Similar-photo groups can help you compare bursts or repeated shots, but you should choose the keeper yourself." = "优先检查长视频、4K 视频、屏幕录制和大尺寸截屏。相似照片分组可以帮助比较连拍或重复照片，但保留哪一张应由你自己决定。";
"Review output settings" = "检查输出设置";
"Review photos, similar items, screenshots, Live Photos, and videos." = "检查照片、相似项目、截屏、Live Photos 和视频。";
"Safari website data" = "Safari 网站数据";
"Safe steps to try" = "可以尝试的安全步骤";
"Save the result" = "保存结果";
"Scan a folder you choose and explore its file distribution." = "扫描选定文件夹并查看文件分布。";
"Scan and explore" = "扫描并探索";
"Scanning and analysis never delete content. Removal begins only after you select items and confirm the action." = "扫描和分析不会删除内容。只有在你选择项目并确认操作后才会开始移除。";
"See why each permission is needed and how your files are protected." = "了解每项权限的用途以及文件如何受到保护。";
"Similar does not mean identical" = "相似不代表完全相同";
"Similar-photo groups are review suggestions, not proof that files are exact duplicates. Keep the best shot before deleting anything." = "相似照片分组只是检查建议，不代表文件完全重复。删除前请保留最佳照片。";
"Start analysis" = "开始分析";
"Start conversion" = "开始转换";
"Start with high-impact items" = "从效果最明显的项目开始";
"Start with iPhone Storage" = "从 iPhone 存储空间开始";
"Step %lld" = "步骤 %lld";
"Storage asks you to choose a folder because iOS does not grant automatic access to all files. Access can expire or change when a file provider becomes unavailable." = "存储要求你选择文件夹，因为 iOS 不会自动授予所有文件的访问权限。当文件提供商不可用时，权限可能失效或改变。";
"Storage can read only the folder you select in the system file picker. The analyzed total describes that folder, not all storage used by the iPhone." = "存储只能读取你在系统文件选择器中选定的文件夹。分析总量描述的是该文件夹，并非 iPhone 使用的全部空间。";
"Storage deletes a confirmed file inside the folder you authorized. Recovery depends on the location and file provider, and is not guaranteed." = "存储会删除你在已授权文件夹中确认的文件。能否恢复取决于位置和文件提供商，无法保证一定可以恢复。";
"Support" = "支持";
"System Data can include temporary files and resources that iOS creates and removes as needed. The total can change while the storage screen recalculates." = "系统数据可能包含 iOS 按需创建和移除的临时文件与资源。存储页面重新计算时，总量可能变化。";
"System Data is managed by iOS" = "系统数据由 iOS 管理";
"The app cannot clear other apps' private data" = "应用无法清除其他 App 的私有数据";
"The app cannot inspect or delete iOS caches, logs, updates, or other protected System Data. No third-party app has general access to that storage." = "应用无法查看或删除 iOS 缓存、日志、更新或其他受保护的系统数据。第三方 App 都没有对这类存储的通用访问权限。";
"The app cannot read Messages or Safari data. Follow the system controls and review their sync and sign-in effects before deleting." = "应用无法读取信息或 Safari 数据。请使用系统控制项，并在删除前了解同步和登录状态的影响。";
"The app never deletes files automatically. You choose what to review and confirm every cleanup action." = "应用不会自动删除文件。你决定检查哪些内容，并确认每次清理操作。";
"The app reports only authorized content and can estimate some media sizes without downloading originals. The iPhone Storage total also includes apps, system data, caches, and content outside that scope." = "应用只报告已授权的内容，并可在不下载原件的情况下估算部分媒体大小。iPhone 存储空间总量还包括 App、系统数据、缓存和范围之外的内容。";
"The original may not be downloaded, the provider may be offline, or permission may have changed. Download it in the owning app or Files, then try again." = "原件可能尚未下载、提供商可能离线，或权限可能已改变。请在所属 App 或“文件”中下载后再试。";
"The original stays where it was" = "原文件保持原位";
"The scope is different. iPhone Storage includes apps and system data, while this app reports authorized content and may estimate media sizes when originals are in iCloud." = "两者范围不同。iPhone 存储空间包括 App 和系统数据，而此应用报告已授权内容，并可能在原件位于 iCloud 时估算媒体大小。";
"These actions happen outside the app" = "这些操作在应用外完成";
"Three focused tools" = "三个专注的工具";
"Understand System Data" = "了解系统数据";
"Understand optimized photos" = "了解优化照片";
"Understand the three tools and what each one can access." = "了解三个工具及其访问范围。";
"Use Apple's controls for attachments, history, and website data." = "使用 Apple 的控制项管理附件、历史记录和网站数据。";
"Use Convert" = "使用转换";
"Use Media" = "使用媒体";
"Use Settings > Apps > Safari to clear history and website data. This can close tabs or sign you out of websites, so save anything important first." = "前往“设置”>“App”>“Safari”清除历史记录和网站数据。这可能关闭标签页或退出网站登录，请先保存重要内容。";
"Use Storage" = "使用存储";
"Use Storage deletion carefully" = "谨慎使用存储删除";
"Use iPhone Storage or the conversation details in Messages to review large attachments. With Messages in iCloud, deletion syncs across your devices; Recently Deleted can continue using space." = "使用 iPhone 存储空间或“信息”中的对话详情查看大附件。启用 iCloud 信息后，删除会同步到各设备；“最近删除”可能仍占用空间。";
"Use the right tool" = "使用正确的工具";
"What happens with Limited Photos Access?" = "使用“有限访问”照片权限会怎样？";
"What the app cannot see" = "应用无法查看的内容";
"When iCloud Photos is on, deleting a photo or video removes it from other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." = "启用 iCloud 照片时，删除照片或视频会将其从登录同一 Apple 账户的其他设备移除。";
"Why did free space not update immediately?" = "为什么可用空间没有立即更新？";
"Why is the analyzed size different from iPhone Storage?" = "为什么分析大小与 iPhone 存储空间不同？";
"Why the number changes" = "数字为什么会变化";
"Why totals can differ" = "总量为什么会不同";
"Why was an iCloud file skipped?" = "为什么跳过了 iCloud 文件？";
"With Optimize iPhone Storage enabled, some originals remain in iCloud while smaller versions stay on the device. Media size can therefore be an estimate until the original is available." = "启用“优化 iPhone 存储空间”后，部分原件保留在 iCloud，设备上只保留较小的版本。因此在原件可用前，媒体大小可能只是估算值。";
"You choose the scan scope" = "扫描范围由你选择";
"Your choices stay in control" = "选择权始终在你手中";
"iCloud Photos syncs deletions" = "iCloud 照片会同步删除";
"iOS does not let one app browse another app's private files, system caches, or the entire iPhone file system. When a category is outside the app's access, Help shows the safe system path instead." = "iOS 不允许一个 App 浏览另一个 App 的私有文件、系统缓存或整个 iPhone 文件系统。当某个类别超出应用访问范围时，帮助会提供安全的系统路径。";
"iOS keeps each app's documents and caches private. Use iPhone Storage and the controls inside each app instead." = "iOS 会将每个 App 的文稿和缓存保持私有。请使用 iPhone 存储空间和各 App 自带的控制项。";
"iPhone Storage measures space on this device. iCloud storage measures data kept in your iCloud account. Freeing one does not always free the other." = "iPhone 存储空间衡量此设备上的空间，iCloud 存储空间衡量 iCloud 账户中的数据。释放其中一项不一定会释放另一项。";
"Display Options" = "显示选项";
"Interface Animations" = "界面动画";
"Show Media Dates" = "显示媒体日期";
"Control dashboard animations and date headings in media detail grids." = "控制媒体“我的空间”、存储旭日图、转换卡片动画以及媒体详情网格中的日期标题。";
"Calculating size…" = "正在计算大小…";
"Size unavailable" = "大小不可用";
